      "transcriber_notes": [
        "Italic section headings ('Belonging to ...', province names) are given as heading rows in printed order.",
        "The 'Group' column is printed only for the 30th-56th Divisions on p. 742, as braces: 30th-31st 2nd Group; 32nd-43rd 3rd Group; 44th-49th Central Government; 50th-56th 4th Group. These divisions are printed directly after the 2nd Army Group list without a new 'Belonging to' heading; the 2nd-9th Temporary Mixed/Cavalry Brigades follow them, also without a heading.",
        "Unit and commander are separated in print sometimes by a comma, sometimes by '...'; separators dropped.",
        "2nd Independent Artillery Regiment, Commander (Chinese): first character 樊 legible, second character unclear (resembles 眗/昫) — left blank.",
        "2nd Temporary Mixed Brigade, Commander (Chinese): printed 甄?任, middle glyph could be 十 or 士 — left blank.",
        "37th Division 王 and 40th Division 關 printed with damaged type; 34th Division printed without comma ('34th Division Hsu Yung-chang').",
        "Section 'Szechwan' shows 180,000 men here; p. 744 text gives 'About 190,000' — transcribed as printed, not reconciled."
      ],
